Modul C ini fokus pada Data Analytics Serverless di AWS menggunakan S3 + Glue + Athena + OpenSearch.

Alur Kerja Lengkap
Data CSV Mentah
        │
        ▼
S3 (raw-data)
        │
        ▼
Glue Crawler
(deteksi schema otomatis)
        │
        ▼
Glue Data Catalog
(metadata tabel)
        │
        ▼
Glue ETL Job (PySpark)
(cleaning + transform)
        │
        ▼
S3 (processed-data)
(format Parquet)
        │
        ▼
Athena
(SQL Query)
        │
        ▼
OpenSearch Dashboard
(visualisasi)
1. Siapkan Data Mentah

Misalnya file:

transactions.csv

transaction_id,user_id,category,amount,status,created_at
TX001,U001,Food,100,Success,2026-01-01
TX002,U002,Transport,50,Success,2026-01-02
TX003,U003,Food,200,Success,2026-01-03
TX004,U001,Shopping,500,Failed,2026-01-05
TX005,U004,Food,300,Success,2026-01-06

Upload ke bucket:

s3://lks2026-data/raw/transactions.csv
2. Buat Bucket S3

Masuk:

AWS Console
→ S3
→ Create Bucket

Nama:

lks2026-data

Struktur folder:

lks2026-data
│
├── raw/
│    └── transactions.csv
│
└── processed/
3. Buat Glue Database

Masuk:

AWS Glue
→ Data Catalog
→ Databases
→ Add Database

Nama:

lks2026_db
4. Buat Glue Crawler

Masuk:

AWS Glue
→ Crawlers
→ Create Crawler
Data Source
S3

Path:

s3://lks2026-data/raw/
Target Database
lks2026_db

Crawler Name:

raw-transactions-crawler

Run crawler.

5. Hasil Crawler

Crawler akan membuat tabel:

raw_transactions

Schema otomatis:

Column	Type
transaction_id	string
user_id	string
category	string
amount	bigint
status	string
created_at	string
6. Buat IAM Role Glue

Masuk:

IAM
→ Roles
→ Create Role

Pilih:

Glue

Tambahkan policy:

AWSGlueServiceRole
AmazonS3FullAccess

Nama:

GlueETLRole
7. Buat Glue ETL Job

Masuk:

Glue
→ ETL Jobs
→ Create Job

Nama:

transaction-etl

IAM Role:

GlueETLRole

Engine:

Spark

Version:

Glue 5.0
8. Masukkan Script ETL

Script yang Anda kirim sudah benar.

Fungsinya:

Membersihkan data
.dropna(subset=['transaction_id', 'amount'])

Menghapus data kosong.

Filter transaksi valid
.filter(col('amount') > 0)

Menghapus nilai negatif atau nol.

Konversi tanggal
.withColumn('transaction_date',
            to_date(col('created_at')))

Contoh:

2026-01-01

menjadi tipe date.

Membuat partisi
.withColumn('year', ...)
.withColumn('month', ...)

Hasil:

Date	Year	Month
2026-01-01	2026	1
Menyimpan ke Parquet
.partitionBy("year","month")
.parquet(...)

Output:

processed/
└── transactions/
    └── year=2026/
         └── month=1/
              part-00000.parquet
9. Jalankan Job

Klik:

Run Job

Tunggu status:

Succeeded

Cek hasil di:

s3://lks2026-data/processed/transactions/
10. Query dengan Athena

Masuk:

Athena

Buat database:

CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS lks2026_db;

Buat tabel:

CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE lks2026_db.transactions (
  transaction_id STRING,
  user_id STRING,
  category STRING,
  amount DOUBLE,
  status STRING
)
PARTITIONED BY (
  year INT,
  month INT
)
STORED AS PARQUET
LOCATION 's3://lks2026-data/processed/transactions/';

Load partisi:

MSCK REPAIR TABLE lks2026_db.transactions;
11. Contoh Query Athena
Total transaksi per kategori
SELECT
 category,
 COUNT(*) total_tx,
 SUM(amount) total_amount
FROM lks2026_db.transactions
GROUP BY category;

Hasil:

Category	Total Tx	Amount
Food	3	600
Transport	1	50
Shopping	1	500
Top kategori
SELECT
 category,
 SUM(amount) total_amount
FROM lks2026_db.transactions
GROUP BY category
ORDER BY total_amount DESC
LIMIT 5;
Total transaksi sukses
SELECT
 SUM(amount)
FROM lks2026_db.transactions
WHERE status='Success';

Hasil:

650
12. Integrasi OpenSearch

Buat domain OpenSearch:

Amazon OpenSearch Service
→ Create Domain

Nama:

lks2026-opensearch

Engine:

OpenSearch 2.x

Deployment:

Development and Testing
13. Athena → OpenSearch

Cara yang umum dipakai:

Athena
→ Query Result
→ S3
→ Lambda / Glue
→ OpenSearch Index

Contoh index:

transactions

Dokumen:

{
  "transaction_id":"TX001",
  "category":"Food",
  "amount":100,
  "status":"Success"
}
14. Dashboard OpenSearch

Buat visualisasi:

Pie Chart
Category Distribution

Menampilkan:

Food 60%
Transport 10%
Shopping 30%
Bar Chart
Top Categories by Revenue
Time Series
Transactions Per Day
Optimasi yang Sering Ditanya Saat LKS
Gunakan Parquet

CSV:

100 MB

Parquet:

10–20 MB

Lebih cepat dan lebih murah.

Gunakan Partisi
year=2026/month=1

Athena hanya membaca folder yang dibutuhkan.

Contoh:

WHERE year=2026
AND month=1

Biaya query jauh lebih kecil.

